00:06:07.567 --> 00:06:09.869
Why does he continue to have these spells

00:06:09.869 --> 00:06:11.003
and to is then,

00:06:11.003 --> 00:06:11.237
you know,

00:06:11.237 --> 00:06:13.873
drawing a connection from lightheadedness

00:06:13.873 --> 00:06:15.441
