00:06:17.944 --> 00:06:19.412
to connect all those dots.

00:06:20.613 --> 00:06:21.280
So interesting.

00:06:21.280 --> 00:06:23.049
So important to have, Sanjay,

00:06:23.049 --> 00:06:24.117
with all of this

00:06:24.117 --> 00:06:24.617
and the updates

00:06:24.617 --> 00:06:25.852
